The legal text is the Constitution of the Independent State of Papua New Guinea as published by the National
Parliament of Papua New Guinea (https://parliament.gov.pg/constitution-of-png/), a consolidated reprint of the
Office of Legislative Counsel, read on 29 October 2026. The page carries no licence statement. The text is
reproduced as an official publication of the Parliament, with attribution to it.

The arrangement of this repository, its tables, commit messages and tools are by Lexifina and may be
reused under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). This repository is not legal advice and not an official
publication.
